1
00:01:37,780 --> 00:01:43,009
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,650
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,729 --> 00:01:45,800
[Episode 2]

4
00:01:56,229 --> 00:01:57,710
Master, latest news:

5
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:59,310
the puppet doll has appeared
in Dougu County,

6
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:00,640
and its trail ends in Black Wind Forest.

7
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,400
Constable Ghost Meng Rui has also

8
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,790
headed toward Dougu.

9
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:26,850
[The Immortal Flower:
The Missing Children Case]

10
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:29,490
[Law Prevails]

11
00:02:28,030 --> 00:02:30,079
The recent case files
submitted by Suzhou report that

12
00:02:29,590 --> 00:02:31,620
[Proceedings Before the County Magistrate]
[Children Missing in Dougu County, Suzhou]

13
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:31,890
over the past 2 months,

14
00:02:31,910 --> 00:02:33,000
a total of 29 children

15
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,800
have gone missing in Dougu County.

16
00:02:35,820 --> 00:02:36,710
There have also

17
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:37,960
been sightings of

18
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,079
the puppet doll.

19
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,840
The case of the missing girls
in Tianhuang City remains unsolved,

20
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,700
and now there are

21
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:46,590
new cases of missing children
in Dougu County—

22
00:02:46,590 --> 00:02:49,240
both involving traces of the puppet doll.

23
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:51,490
There must be a connection

24
00:02:51,490 --> 00:02:52,680
between the two.

25
00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,880
Constable Ghost Meng Rui, heed my command!

26
00:02:55,880 --> 00:02:56,870
Yes, My Lady.

27
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:58,730
Set out overnight for Dougu County

28
00:02:58,730 --> 00:03:00,630
to investigate the case of
the missing children.

29
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:01,430
Understood.

30
00:03:01,840 --> 00:03:03,190
[Over the past 2 months,]

31
00:03:03,190 --> 00:03:04,080
[a total of 29 children]

32
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:06,210
[have been reported missing
within the county.]

33
00:03:06,210 --> 00:03:07,520
[Witnesses also claim]

34
00:03:07,090 --> 00:03:10,200
[Dougu County, Suzhou, Great Shi]

35
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,590
[that the puppet doll]

36
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:10,910
[has repeatedly been seen
at the time of the incidents.]

37
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:11,910
[All residents are hereby urged]

38
00:03:11,910 --> 00:03:13,910
[to keep a close watch
over their children,]

39
00:03:13,910 --> 00:03:15,190
[shut doors early in the evening,]

40
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:17,470
[Proclamation to the People
of Dougu County]

41
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:16,590
[and not allow them to go out alone.]

42
00:03:16,590 --> 00:03:18,680
[Anyone who spots traces of
the puppet doll]

43
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,310
[must report immediately to
the authorities.]

44
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:21,430
[Rewards will be given whether
the information proves true or false.]

45
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:23,160
Sir, what would you like to eat?

46
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,310
Boss,

47
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:26,120
so many children

48
00:03:26,310 --> 00:03:28,240
have gone missing in your Dougu County?

49
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,240
Exactly.

50
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,800
Twenty-nine of them.

51
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,590
It's got everyone on edge.

52
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:33,910
And what's with

53
00:03:33,910 --> 00:03:35,470
the puppet doll

54
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,240
mentioned on this proclamation?

55
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:38,120
Someone saw

56
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,030
that kid

57
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:40,760
was taken away by a puppet doll.

58
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:42,910
How weird is that?

59
00:03:44,590 --> 00:03:45,400
Boss,

60
00:03:45,430 --> 00:03:46,310
are the noodles ready?

61
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:46,710
Hurry up!

62
00:03:46,710 --> 00:03:48,520
-Coming right up. Just a second.
-We've been waiting for ages!

63
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,120
Just a second. Just a second.

64
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:51,840
Eat!

65
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,310
You little brat!

66
00:03:57,470 --> 00:03:58,870
Boss, don't worry about her.

67
00:03:58,870 --> 00:04:00,000
Even if she starves to death,

68
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,590
we can still get the money.

69
00:04:01,590 --> 00:04:03,030
Keep your voice down!

70
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:08,540
Everyone, stop eating.

71
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:09,820
Bro, let's go!

72
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:10,910
Let's go!

73
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:11,470
Come with us!

74
00:04:11,470 --> 00:04:12,190
Come on. Come on!

75
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:12,870
Move!

76
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:13,590
Hurry up!

77
00:04:13,590 --> 00:04:14,120
Hurry!

78
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:14,630
Move!

79
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:19,060
[Noodles]

80
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:17,720
According to the law of the Great Shi,

81
00:04:17,720 --> 00:04:19,800
those who abduct or sell children

82
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:21,510
shall be branded on the face,

83
00:04:21,510 --> 00:04:23,040
given 100 strokes of the rod,

84
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,170
and exiled 1,000 li.

85
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:28,580
Where did you death-seeking brat
come from?

86
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,630
Pretty boy.

87
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:31,720
You must be from another city.

88
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,680
Let me tell you—

89
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,780
in the territory of Dougu County,

90
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,600
even dragons have to coil up

91
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,730
and even tigers have to lie down for me.

92
00:04:39,070 --> 00:04:41,190
Don't try to tell me what to do.

93
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:42,830
Here's my advice:

94
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:46,310
keep your head down
and mind your own business.

95
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:47,600
Do you know who we are?

96
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:50,170
It would scare you to death if I told you!

97
00:04:50,170 --> 00:04:51,670
[Noodles]

98
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,310
Do you want to die?

99
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,640
[Noodles]

100
00:05:20,870 --> 00:05:21,680
Little girl.

101
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,120
Come here.

102
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:26,920
Are you okay?

103
00:05:31,510 --> 00:05:32,310
Just now,

104
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:34,310
which one of you said

105
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,600
I didn't know who you are?

106
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,360
Go on then, you can tell me now.
I'm ready to be scared.

107
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,120
Please spare my life, My Lord!

108
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,510
-Let me ask you.
-I was blind to your identity.

109
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:43,630
Were the children mentioned
on that proclamation

110
00:05:43,630 --> 00:05:45,340
all abducted by you guys?

111
00:05:45,480 --> 00:05:46,800
No, no, no, hero!

112
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:49,190
That has nothing to do with us!

113
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,870
Our boss only took us

114
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:52,680
to abduct this one child.

115
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:53,560
We were just discussing

116
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,040
how to trade her for money

117
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:56,310
when we ran into you.

118
00:05:56,310 --> 00:05:56,600
Yeah, yeah.

119
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,120
Just this one.

120
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,120
We know we were wrong!

121
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:00,190
-We know we were wrong!
-We know we were wrong!

122
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:01,000
You lot—

123
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:03,830
go to the county government
and turn yourself in.

124
00:06:03,830 --> 00:06:05,290
If any of you try to flee...

125
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:11,890
Do you understand?

126
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:16,740
-Thank you, My Lord! Thank you, My Lord!
-We'll turn ourselves in right away!

127
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:20,390
Hurry.

128
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:21,310
Are you okay?

129
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,430
Please enjoy, sir.

130
00:06:29,270 --> 00:06:30,510
Here. For the noodles.

131
00:06:30,510 --> 00:06:31,310
Thank you.

132
00:06:43,390 --> 00:06:44,390
You want to see me?

133
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:47,680
What's your name?

134
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,460
Sun Yuyao.

135
00:06:51,070 --> 00:06:52,530
Anything you want from me?

136
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:01,110
[Proclamation]

137
00:07:04,150 --> 00:07:05,420
Who gave you this?

138
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,070
Mr. Young Master.

139
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:09,590
Mr. Young Master?

140
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,120
Could it be...

141
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:13,800
Boss.

142
00:07:14,630 --> 00:07:15,430
Sir.

143
00:07:15,870 --> 00:07:16,720
Boss.

144
00:07:16,870 --> 00:07:18,130
Have you seen this man?

145
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,240
It was this gentleman

146
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:22,680
who rescued the girl from the bandits

147
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,810
of Niutou Mountain.

148
00:07:23,830 --> 00:07:24,630
Are you sure?

149
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,630
Of course.

150
00:07:26,720 --> 00:07:27,800
A face like his

151
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,510
is one in a million.

152
00:07:30,270 --> 00:07:31,870
He actually came here too.

153
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:34,510
Did you see

154
00:07:34,530 --> 00:07:35,710
where he went?

155
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:38,430
Toward the county town. That way.

156
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:43,630
Yuyao.

157
00:07:43,870 --> 00:07:45,070
Do you want to go home?

158
00:07:46,870 --> 00:07:48,680
Mr. Young Master was right.

159
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,480
I knew you'd take me home.

160
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,530
Come on. I'll take you home.

161
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:58,920
Sir. Sir.

162
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:00,430
Sir.

163
00:08:01,090 --> 00:08:02,600
Do you think I should go collect my reward

164
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:03,830
at the Divine Constable Bureau

165
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:04,600
or...

166
00:08:06,430 --> 00:08:07,190
Here.

167
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:07,920
Thank you, sir.

168
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:08,430
Let's go.

169
00:08:08,430 --> 00:08:09,630
Thank you. Thank you.

170
00:08:10,070 --> 00:08:11,870
Thank you, sir. Take care.

171
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:14,430
Well done.

172
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,190
Here. As I promised.

173
00:08:15,320 --> 00:08:15,670
[Proclamation]

174
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:19,630
Boss.

175
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,640
It's only been half a day,

176
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,720
and you've already earned

177
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,270
40 taels overall.

178
00:08:24,570 --> 00:08:25,240
Sir.

179
00:08:25,270 --> 00:08:26,270
You kept your word—

180
00:08:26,270 --> 00:08:27,510
what admirable character.

181
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:29,480
[Proclamation]

182
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,070
That officer from just now

183
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:30,430
doesn't look like
someone to be trifled with.

184
00:08:30,430 --> 00:08:32,270
You'd better leave early.

185
00:08:32,870 --> 00:08:34,870
Who said I was leaving Dougu County?

186
00:08:35,270 --> 00:08:37,669
I'm even worried
he won't be able to find me.

187
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,870
Thank you, sir!

188
00:08:39,870 --> 00:08:41,630
Go get your master to come out
and see patients.

189
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:42,909
Please be quiet, everyone.

190
00:08:42,909 --> 00:08:44,120
Listen to me, everyone.

191
00:08:43,020 --> 00:08:45,970
[Chunfeng Hall]

192
00:08:44,270 --> 00:08:46,510
Master has been deeply worried

193
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,200
due to his daughter's disappearance.

194
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,510
He's not seeing patients for now.

195
00:08:49,510 --> 00:08:50,340
Not seeing patients?

196
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:50,860
-That's right.
-Not seeing patients?

197
00:08:50,860 --> 00:08:51,690
This won't do.

198
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,770
So including Yuyao,

199
00:08:52,770 --> 00:08:53,600
that makes

200
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,790
30 children missing, right?

201
00:08:54,790 --> 00:08:55,550
What on earth has our Dougu County

202
00:08:55,550 --> 00:08:57,240
-done to deserve this?
-Sir.

203
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,600
-My house is right ahead.
-Those missing children.

204
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,480
Their parents must be super worried.

205
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,510
The puppet that abducted people—

206
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:02,510
-Yuyao?
-Is it a human or a ghost?

207
00:09:02,510 --> 00:09:03,360
Yuyao, you're back!

208
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,120
My Lady!

209
00:09:04,670 --> 00:09:06,200
My Lady, you're back!

210
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,440
Mr. Wang.

211
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:10,510
Sir, may I ask who you are?

212
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,840
It was this gentleman

213
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,120
who brought me home.

214
00:09:14,050 --> 00:09:20,070
[Chunfeng Hall]

215
00:09:14,910 --> 00:09:16,030
Esteemed hero.

216
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:18,030
By bringing our young lady back,

217
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:18,840
you've saved the lives

218
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:20,630
of our master and madam.

219
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:22,430
Please. No need for this.

220
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,120
Now that Yuyao is back,

221
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:25,630
go tell your master to open the clinic
and start seeing patients again.

222
00:09:25,630 --> 00:09:26,720
-Yeah.
-That's right.

223
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,670
Mother.

224
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,500
My tooth hurts!

225
00:09:30,030 --> 00:09:31,120
Mr. Wang, look.

226
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,790
Our Yuanbao

227
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:32,670
is at the age of losing his baby teeth.

228
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:34,120
He's been complaining of tooth pain.

229
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,080
Please ask Master Sun

230
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,480
to come out and take a look at him.

231
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,030
If he really can't see him,

232
00:09:37,030 --> 00:09:37,870
he could at least write us a prescription—

233
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:38,320
we can go home

234
00:09:38,320 --> 00:09:39,790
and decoct the medicine ourselves.

235
00:09:39,790 --> 00:09:41,120
Mrs. Hua, this...

236
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:44,270
[Chunfeng Hall]

237
00:09:43,030 --> 00:09:43,790
Hurry up. Come on.

238
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:44,990
Be careful. Let's go.

239
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,080
Officer!

240
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:48,910
It's Master! He...

241
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,000
Father!

242
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:54,870
Take Yuyao away.

243
00:09:54,870 --> 00:09:55,510
Father!

244
00:09:55,510 --> 00:09:57,870
-Father!
-Everyone, please go home.

245
00:09:57,870 --> 00:09:59,510
-Just go home, everyone!
-Father!

246
00:09:59,510 --> 00:10:01,000
Break it up, everyone.

247
00:10:44,210 --> 00:10:45,820
What a peculiar scent.

248
00:11:08,110 --> 00:11:10,290
[Chief Constable's Hall]

249
00:11:11,570 --> 00:11:13,540
[Chief Constable's Hall]

250
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:17,820
[Chief Constable's Hall]

251
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,670
Twenty-nine children in Dougu County

252
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:22,600
have gone missing without a trace.

253
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:24,390
Now there's the dismemberment case
of the proprietor of Chunfeng Hall—

254
00:11:24,390 --> 00:11:25,910
threads were found tangled
among the severed limbs,

255
00:11:25,910 --> 00:11:27,240
along with a peculiar scent.

256
00:11:26,060 --> 00:11:29,070
[Chief Constable's Hall]

257
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:29,880
And Li Si has also appeared
in Dougu County.

258
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,510
The victim's body shows no visible wounds,

259
00:11:33,510 --> 00:11:35,370
and the murder weapon is unknown.

260
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,740
The skin is slightly damaged.

261
00:11:36,740 --> 00:11:37,740
Wet it with water,

262
00:11:38,080 --> 00:11:40,340
then apply mashed scallion whites on it.

263
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:23,470
Rinse it off, and the marks will appear.

264
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:31,320
Such fine needle marks.

265
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,000
The weapon must be

266
00:12:38,000 --> 00:12:39,080
the threads used to

267
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,480
control the puppet doll,

268
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:42,040
piercing the blood vessels

269
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,280
to draw the blood out.

270
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:49,080
The threads sent back by

271
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,100
Constable Ghost from Dougu County

272
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:52,270
also carry the scent of Dead Bone Spice.

273
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:53,320
If that's the case,

274
00:12:53,290 --> 00:12:56,360
[Clear as a Mirror]

275
00:12:53,450 --> 00:12:54,720
then the Dougu County case

276
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:56,870
is indeed connected to
the Spice-Refining Case.

277
00:12:56,870 --> 00:12:59,080
It's very likely the work of
the same person.

278
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:01,510
Twenty-nine children have vanished
without a trace,

279
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:03,030
their fate still unknown.

280
00:13:03,670 --> 00:13:05,000
The entire Dougu County

281
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:07,720
is in uproar, with grievances everywhere
and rumors spreading wildly,

282
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,440
even reaching

283
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:10,240
Tianhuang City.

284
00:13:10,270 --> 00:13:11,670
Judging by the timeline,

285
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:13,270
the child disappearance cases

286
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:15,000
and the Young Girl Spice-Refining Case

287
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,670
happened to occur in sequence.

288
00:13:16,670 --> 00:13:17,630
And just as Constable Ghost

289
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:19,180
has been dispatched to investigate,

290
00:13:19,180 --> 00:13:22,180
[Clear as a Mirror]

291
00:13:19,510 --> 00:13:22,170
another dismemberment murder
has taken place.

292
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:24,270
If all these incidents are indeed

293
00:13:24,270 --> 00:13:25,840
the work of the same person,

294
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:27,390
then he must be plotting

295
00:13:27,390 --> 00:13:29,320
an earth-shattering conspiracy.

296
00:13:30,930 --> 00:13:36,400
[Clear as a Mirror]

297
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:33,720
Constable Ghost also reported
something else—

298
00:13:33,720 --> 00:13:37,120
someone in Dougu County has claimed to
have seen Li Qingyang.

299
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:44,320
Looks like this Young Master Qingyang

300
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,980
is always one step ahead of us.

301
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:46,910
What do you think

302
00:13:46,910 --> 00:13:47,970
about this person?

303
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:50,080
If he were truly on the run,

304
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:51,270
there are countless places
he could flee to—

305
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:52,720
why choose Dougu County of all places?

306
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,720
That couldn't have been a coincidence.

307
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:55,870
Moreover, he once said

308
00:13:55,870 --> 00:13:57,600
he would personally avenge Qing Wu.

309
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,790
So I believe

310
00:13:58,910 --> 00:13:59,670
that ever since the puppet doll

311
00:13:59,670 --> 00:14:00,910
was discovered at Star-Gathering Pavilion,

312
00:14:00,910 --> 00:14:01,910
he has been entangled in this case

313
00:14:01,910 --> 00:14:02,790
the entire time—

314
00:14:02,790 --> 00:14:04,520
he must be scheming something.

315
00:14:06,380 --> 00:14:11,890
[Clear as a Mirror]

316
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:09,790
Li Si, Young Master Qingyang,

317
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:12,240
was actually willing to throw himself
into the fray

318
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:15,040
and even tried to break into
the Tianshu Pavilion—

319
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,840
what exactly is he up to?

320
00:14:20,030 --> 00:14:20,840
For now,

321
00:14:20,870 --> 00:14:22,600
let's focus on solving the cases first.

322
00:14:22,600 --> 00:14:23,390
Zhenzhu,

323
00:14:23,510 --> 00:14:25,140
set out immediately to Dougu County

324
00:14:25,140 --> 00:14:26,630
to assist Constable Ghost.

325
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:27,510
The female spice-maker murder,

326
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:28,270
the missing children,

327
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,510
and the proprietor dismemberment case—

328
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:30,910
investigate these 3 cases together.

329
00:14:30,910 --> 00:14:31,720
Understood!

330
00:14:39,550 --> 00:14:42,080
[Dougu County Office]

331
00:14:40,870 --> 00:14:42,200
Who's beating the drum?

332
00:14:42,510 --> 00:14:44,570
Don't you know the court is off today?

333
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:51,660
[Du Yi'an, Dougu County Magistrate]

334
00:14:54,420 --> 00:14:56,850
[Dougu County Office]

335
00:14:55,390 --> 00:14:57,080
Why are there so many people here today?

336
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:57,910
My Lord.

337
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,910
Our master was brutally killed at home,

338
00:15:00,910 --> 00:15:02,120
his body severed.

339
00:15:02,390 --> 00:15:04,600
I beg Your Lordship to quickly
apprehend the murderer

340
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:07,080
and redress our grievance, My Lord!

341
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:08,270
Got it. Got it.

342
00:15:08,690 --> 00:15:09,790
Leave the body here.

343
00:15:09,790 --> 00:15:11,250
You may all return for now.

344
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:13,100
-My Lord! My Lord...
-What about you guys?

345
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:14,280
My Lord,

346
00:15:14,310 --> 00:15:15,150
3 years ago,

347
00:15:15,150 --> 00:15:16,230
I robbed an old lady

348
00:15:16,250 --> 00:15:17,380
and took 80 coppers.

349
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,480
Please, my merciful lord,

350
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:19,510
lock me up!

351
00:15:19,510 --> 00:15:20,670
My Lord, I've also
committed robbery before!

352
00:15:20,670 --> 00:15:21,990
My Lord, please lock me up!

353
00:15:21,990 --> 00:15:23,080
You should arrest me.

354
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,270
That old lady tried to
report me to the authorities later,

355
00:15:24,270 --> 00:15:25,480
and I gave her another beating.

356
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,720
My sins are beyond forgiveness!

357
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,910
We're bandits of Niutou Mountain.

358
00:15:27,910 --> 00:15:28,910
We've all lost our senses!

359
00:15:28,910 --> 00:15:29,270
My Lord!

360
00:15:29,270 --> 00:15:31,440
-Enough. That's enough!
-Our manager died unjustly.

361
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,110
There aren't enough cells in the jail

362
00:15:32,110 --> 00:15:33,840
for that many people.

363
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:35,100
How about this—

364
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,080
come and register with the Advisor,

365
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,030
take a number,

366
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,320
and then go back to

367
00:15:38,570 --> 00:15:40,080
Niutou Mountain
and wait for further notice.

368
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:42,000
When there are vacancies in the jail,

369
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,360
you can come serve your sentence then.

370
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,270
That won't do, My Lord!

371
00:15:44,270 --> 00:15:45,140
We won't be able to
live with our conscience!

372
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:45,840
My Lord!

373
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,080
Alright. Enough.

374
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,920
Didn't you hear what His Lordship said?

375
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,120
Break it up.

376
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,030
Come on. Disperse.

377
00:15:52,030 --> 00:15:53,290
That won't do, My Lord!

378
00:15:54,630 --> 00:15:55,440
Stop it.

379
00:15:56,910 --> 00:15:59,000
Du Yi'an, Magistrate of Dougu County,

380
00:15:59,000 --> 00:15:59,870
don't you feel ashamed

381
00:15:59,870 --> 00:16:01,440
to wear that official cap?

382
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:03,870
Who are you?

383
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:06,640
How dare you address me so rudely?

384
00:16:06,910 --> 00:16:07,720
Guards.

385
00:16:07,750 --> 00:16:08,510
Take him down!

386
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:09,200
Yes.

387
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,000
Hold on!

388
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,670
An iron plate?

389
00:16:16,510 --> 00:16:17,200
How dare you!

390
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,510
How dare you ignore the law

391
00:16:18,510 --> 00:16:20,200
and bribe me in public?
That makes your crime even worse!

392
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,240
M-My Lord.

393
00:16:20,850 --> 00:16:21,510
[Constable Ghost]

394
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:22,080
What's wrong?

395
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,270
These 4 characters read

396
00:16:24,270 --> 00:16:25,560
"Passed..."

397
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:28,320
"Passed down through Generations."

398
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,670
Even though he looks well-dressed,

399
00:16:29,670 --> 00:16:30,750
I could tell at a glance

400
00:16:30,750 --> 00:16:31,670
that he's a pauper.

401
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,710
[Constable Ghost]

402
00:16:31,670 --> 00:16:32,870
That shabby iron plate he's holding

403
00:16:32,870 --> 00:16:33,910
is probably some
worthless family heirloom—

404
00:16:33,910 --> 00:16:35,440
not worth a second glance,
nothing special.

405
00:16:35,440 --> 00:16:36,840
No, My Lord.

406
00:16:37,630 --> 00:16:38,720
It says

407
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:42,240
"Acting on Heaven's Authority to Punish."

408
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,270
Also,

409
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:51,380
[Constable Ghost]

410
00:16:45,270 --> 00:16:48,070
there's a smaller line of text above it
that reads:

411
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:50,060
"For ranks below the fifth grade,

412
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:52,720
execute first and report later."

413
00:16:54,030 --> 00:16:56,600
-The Divine Constable Bureau!
-The Divine Constable Bureau!

414
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,440
My Lord!

415
00:16:59,490 --> 00:17:00,270
[Constable Ghost]

416
00:16:59,910 --> 00:17:01,720
I was blind and failed to recognize

417
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,240
your esteemed presence

418
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:05,480
in our Dougu County, Divine Constable!

419
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:06,640
Please forgive me for

420
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:08,240
not receiving you properly!

421
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,310
The child disappearance cases

422
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:12,920
and the Chunfeng Hall dismemberment case

423
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,790
will be taken over by

424
00:17:13,790 --> 00:17:16,069
the Divine Constable Bureau,
starting today!

425
00:17:16,069 --> 00:17:17,069
That's great.

426
00:17:17,109 --> 00:17:18,720
I will definitely do my best

427
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:19,589
to help you solve the cases.

428
00:17:19,589 --> 00:17:20,270
If there's anything you need,

429
00:17:20,270 --> 00:17:21,089
let me know anytime.

430
00:17:21,089 --> 00:17:25,020
-I'll definitely do my best to...
-Where's the coroner of your county?

431
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,380
[Dougu County Office]

432
00:17:28,630 --> 00:17:29,030
[Coroner's Office]

433
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:30,600
Lord Constable Ghost.

434
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:35,640
[Coroner's Office]

435
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:35,070
Lord Constable Ghost.

436
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:36,330
Lord Constable Ghost.

437
00:17:36,890 --> 00:17:39,200
Forensic examination by the coroner
requires meticulous care

438
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,640
and will take some time.

439
00:17:40,790 --> 00:17:41,590
Why not

440
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,110
go rest in the side hall for a while?

441
00:17:43,110 --> 00:17:43,920
That's right.

442
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:45,590
You've traveled far, My Lord,

443
00:17:45,590 --> 00:17:46,790
and we haven't had the chance to

444
00:17:46,790 --> 00:17:48,510
receive you properly.

445
00:17:57,110 --> 00:17:59,440
You're so diligent in official duties,
Lord Constable Ghost.

446
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,920
I deeply admire you.

447
00:17:59,930 --> 00:18:01,420
[Coroner's Office]

448
00:18:03,030 --> 00:18:03,680
My Lord!

449
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:04,480
Keep it down!

450
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,510
My Lord.

451
00:18:05,590 --> 00:18:07,240
A woman has barged in from outside.

452
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:07,960
Useless!

453
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:10,000
You can't even stop a woman.

454
00:18:09,870 --> 00:18:10,930
[Coroner's Office]

455
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:11,600
Where did you come from?

456
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:13,340
How dare you trespass into...

457
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:15,680
You got here fast.

458
00:18:15,680 --> 00:18:16,200
What are you looking at?

459
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:17,920
-It's serious. I couldn't afford to delay.
-You...

460
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:19,070
Why didn't you stop her?

461
00:18:19,070 --> 00:18:20,790
As you instructed, we only stop men,
not women.

462
00:18:20,790 --> 00:18:21,550
Nonsense!

463
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:28,510
I can't believe

464
00:18:28,510 --> 00:18:30,030
I've been blind twice in a day.

465
00:18:30,030 --> 00:18:30,810
Lord Constable Ghost.

466
00:18:30,810 --> 00:18:32,610
This must be your wife, right?

467
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,720
Your wife is indeed beautiful

468
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,270
and virtuous.

469
00:18:37,590 --> 00:18:40,000
I'm Constable Frost Bai Zhenzhu from
the Divine Constable Bureau.

470
00:18:38,110 --> 00:18:39,690
[Constable Frost]

471
00:18:41,030 --> 00:18:42,270
So I've actually been blind

472
00:18:42,270 --> 00:18:43,790
3 times in a single day.

473
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:46,210
Please forgive me, Lady Constable Frost.

474
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,300
The body's inside.

475
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,960
Their coroner is currently examining it.

476
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:51,960
Let's take a look.

477
00:18:52,030 --> 00:18:54,030
There are so many people in the yard.

478
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:08,750
My Lord,

479
00:19:09,070 --> 00:19:10,720
have I come late?

480
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:12,740
Please forgive me.

481
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,030
Wen Nansheng,

482
00:19:14,030 --> 00:19:15,830
aren't you conducting an autopsy inside?

483
00:19:15,830 --> 00:19:17,110
Why are you here?

484
00:19:17,250 --> 00:19:18,080
My Lord,

485
00:19:18,310 --> 00:19:20,110
there was a government officer
who asked me to come here.

486
00:19:20,110 --> 00:19:21,070
But just a moment later,

487
00:19:21,070 --> 00:19:22,310
another officer from
the Divine Constable Bureau

488
00:19:22,310 --> 00:19:23,590
came to my house,

489
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:24,920
saying that Divine Constable

490
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,920
wished to have a drink with you, Mr. Du,

491
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:27,920
and the autopsy wasn't urgent,

492
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,480
so he told me to come later instead.

493
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:30,740
So you're the coroner?

494
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,510
It's you.

495
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:39,590
Li Qingyang?

496
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:40,680
Lord Constable Ghost.

497
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,940
Lady Constable Frost.

498
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:44,110
It's indeed a small world.

499
00:19:53,590 --> 00:19:54,520
Leave this to me.

500
00:20:59,750 --> 00:21:01,070
Why do you have this?

501
00:21:09,350 --> 00:21:11,210
This is called the Spider's Tear.

502
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:14,880
It cannot be broken by weapons,
and it's impervious to water and fire.

503
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:17,590
It's extremely fine, transparent,
and incredibly sharp

504
00:21:17,590 --> 00:21:19,480
It can be used to control puppets,

505
00:21:19,510 --> 00:21:20,510
and it also serves

506
00:21:20,960 --> 00:21:22,550
as a weapon to kill.

507
00:21:22,750 --> 00:21:25,070
Even something as tough as bamboo

508
00:21:25,110 --> 00:21:26,710
can be severed upon contact—

509
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:27,680
let alone

510
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:30,000
Master Sun's flesh and blood.

511
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,830
Then according to what you're saying,

512
00:21:31,830 --> 00:21:32,590
this is the tool

513
00:21:32,590 --> 00:21:34,790
which was used to dismember Master Sun?

514
00:21:34,960 --> 00:21:36,070
I've also found

515
00:21:36,590 --> 00:21:38,960
the place where the missing children
of Dougu County

516
00:21:38,960 --> 00:21:40,790
were last seen.

517
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,070
It was this very

518
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,550
Black Wind Forest.

519
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:54,520
You seem to know an awful lot—

520
00:21:55,440 --> 00:21:57,510
then you must be the prime suspect.

521
00:21:57,830 --> 00:21:59,430
I'll place you under arrest.

522
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,640
Let me remind you—

523
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:03,830
this is the second time

524
00:22:03,830 --> 00:22:04,960
you've drawn your sword on me.

525
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,030
If you still can't

526
00:22:06,350 --> 00:22:08,240
take my life this time,

527
00:22:08,590 --> 00:22:10,850
I think the title "Reaper Sword" of yours

528
00:22:11,030 --> 00:22:12,510
might need to be changed.

529
00:23:16,350 --> 00:23:17,200
Be careful.

530
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:19,200
It's an illusion.

531
00:23:21,110 --> 00:23:24,310
How am I supposed to believe
this isn't one of your tricks?

532
00:23:56,740 --> 00:23:59,110
Emperor of Heaven,

533
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:01,350
Emperor of Earth,

534
00:24:01,350 --> 00:24:06,070
I have a child who cries at night.

535
00:24:08,640 --> 00:24:11,550
Kind passerby,

536
00:24:11,550 --> 00:24:13,790
please recite this spell,

537
00:24:14,110 --> 00:24:19,720
and he will sleep soundly until daybreak.

538
00:25:47,590 --> 00:25:49,160
The illusion formation here is
far too sinister.

539
00:25:49,160 --> 00:25:50,560
Even I've fallen into it.

540
00:25:54,030 --> 00:25:56,160
I must make a clean break immediately.

541
00:25:57,390 --> 00:25:59,430
Master, I'm sorry.

542
00:26:00,110 --> 00:26:01,570
I have to break my promise.

543
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:32,280
The eldest son is Zhen;
the youngest son is Gen.

544
00:26:32,430 --> 00:26:35,200
The child comes from the mother,
and the mother is the Kun trigram.

545
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:37,460
Yin adheres to yang, whose image is fire.

546
00:26:38,550 --> 00:26:40,400
Adheres to actually means separate from.

547
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:41,930
The "Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation"!

548
00:26:41,930 --> 00:26:42,930
[Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation]

549
00:26:42,930 --> 00:26:43,930
[Veiled-Bird Mingyi Hexagram]

550
00:27:44,240 --> 00:27:46,110
So this is a mass burial ground.

551
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:50,300
They've used illusion techniques
to turn a graveyard into a town.

552
00:27:51,480 --> 00:27:52,940
That's quite unsettling.

553
00:27:58,270 --> 00:27:59,200
Changsuo?

554
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:07,680
[Tomb of Zhang Xiaoniu,
a Child Who Died Young]

555
00:28:06,480 --> 00:28:07,400
Zhang Xiaoniu.

556
00:28:13,030 --> 00:28:13,790
Sui'er.

557
00:28:13,300 --> 00:28:15,660
[Tomb of Sui’er]

558
00:28:15,160 --> 00:28:15,960
Mr. Meng.

559
00:28:18,030 --> 00:28:19,640
These seem to be the names of

560
00:28:19,790 --> 00:28:22,050
of the missing children of Dougu County.

561
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:25,030
Mr. Meng.

562
00:28:25,270 --> 00:28:26,110
Mr. Meng!

563
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:03,010
These are all empty graves.

564
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:04,640
Why are they all empty?

565
00:29:05,830 --> 00:29:07,830
These children must still be alive.

566
00:29:13,270 --> 00:29:17,200
Help me! Help me!

567
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:21,030
Somebody help me! Help me!

568
00:29:21,310 --> 00:29:23,030
Help me!

569
00:29:23,030 --> 00:29:24,230
They're still alive!

570
00:29:25,640 --> 00:29:26,440
Li Si!

571
00:29:26,790 --> 00:29:28,000
The children are still alive!

572
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:28,800
Hang in there!

573
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:30,510
Help me!

574
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:32,640
Spirit pivot, circulation and return,
yin and yang are unfathomable.

575
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:33,440
Break!

576
00:29:39,790 --> 00:29:40,880
See for yourself

577
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:42,310
what you're holding.

578
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:45,420
It was illusion again.

579
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:46,960
Mr. Meng.

580
00:29:47,440 --> 00:29:48,960
This place is way too strange.

581
00:29:48,960 --> 00:29:50,270
If we stay here,

582
00:29:50,270 --> 00:29:51,680
both of us will die.

583
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:52,680
Let's go.

584
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:19,830
That was really close.

585
00:30:31,070 --> 00:30:32,400
Dragon-whisker Grass?

586
00:30:38,480 --> 00:30:41,160
Dragon-whisker Grass grows in
the most barren and treacherous lands.

587
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:42,220
As the saying goes,

588
00:30:42,310 --> 00:30:45,590
one does not see dragon whisker
unless one reaches absolute extremity.

589
00:30:45,590 --> 00:30:46,720
This material

590
00:30:46,790 --> 00:30:47,920
is extremely tough,

591
00:30:48,270 --> 00:30:50,870
and it's most commonly used for
weaving shoes.

592
00:30:51,750 --> 00:30:53,480
Using it to make a sword sheath,

593
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,880
however, is something
I've never heard of before.

594
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:57,680
Using softness to overcome hardness.

595
00:30:57,680 --> 00:31:00,480
This sword is extremely rigid
and bone-chilling.

596
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,720
Only the resilience of cattail reeds

597
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:02,720
can withstand it.

598
00:31:03,720 --> 00:31:04,960
Rumor has it that

599
00:31:05,350 --> 00:31:08,440
Constable Ghost carries a sword,
known as "Reaper."

600
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:11,000
My sword is named "Severe-Cold."

601
00:31:11,000 --> 00:31:12,030
As for "Reaper",

602
00:31:12,750 --> 00:31:13,720
it's nothing more than a rumor

603
00:31:13,720 --> 00:31:16,440
that's been passed around and exaggerated
in jianghu.

604
00:31:16,440 --> 00:31:18,270
So it actually has its own name,

605
00:31:18,230 --> 00:31:21,520
[Severe-Cold]

606
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:20,830
"Severe-Cold."

607
00:31:22,030 --> 00:31:23,720
What a good name.

608
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:27,280
What was that technique you used

609
00:31:27,680 --> 00:31:29,680
back at the gate of Tianshu Pavilion

610
00:31:30,110 --> 00:31:32,040
and in the hallucination just now?

611
00:31:32,470 --> 00:31:34,240
The Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation.

612
00:31:34,240 --> 00:31:36,030
It borrows the power of heaven, earth,
mountain, and marsh,

613
00:31:36,030 --> 00:31:38,070
using wind, thunder, water, and fire
to attack enemies.

614
00:31:38,070 --> 00:31:39,200
It's just like

615
00:31:40,030 --> 00:31:41,310
flying a kite—

616
00:31:41,480 --> 00:31:42,680
without wind,

617
00:31:42,790 --> 00:31:44,640
the kite can't rise no matter what.

618
00:31:44,640 --> 00:31:45,440
But

619
00:31:45,830 --> 00:31:46,790
once you get

620
00:31:46,790 --> 00:31:48,790
the wind's strength and direction

621
00:31:49,030 --> 00:31:50,440
and calculate it precisely,

622
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:51,310
the kite

623
00:31:51,590 --> 00:31:53,440
naturally takes flight.

624
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:56,720
That is what it means
to borrow the power of nature.

625
00:32:02,030 --> 00:32:03,510
This Heaven-Measuring Ruler
is a divine artifact

626
00:32:03,510 --> 00:32:06,070
forged from a meteorite
beyond the heavens.

627
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:07,070
It can

628
00:32:07,310 --> 00:32:09,510
precisely measure the qi and energy flows
of all things,

629
00:32:09,510 --> 00:32:11,240
and harness them for my own use.

630
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:13,550
Just like that formation from earlier.

631
00:32:13,550 --> 00:32:16,750
In the illusion formation,
there were children and fire,

632
00:32:16,750 --> 00:32:18,960
which corresponded exactly to
the Mingyi hexagram.

633
00:32:18,960 --> 00:32:20,510
And I was able to transform it

634
00:32:20,510 --> 00:32:22,270
into the "Earth Fire Mingyi" formation

635
00:32:22,270 --> 00:32:24,130
to break the illusion formation.

636
00:32:25,270 --> 00:32:28,510
And that's the Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation.

637
00:32:28,510 --> 00:32:31,310
Resolving all kinds of techniques
with one ruler?

638
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:34,680
Not bad.

639
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:38,340
That's a very effective method
for killing.

640
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:42,550
Lord Constable Ghost, so you're

641
00:32:42,550 --> 00:32:43,880
still suspecting me?

642
00:32:47,350 --> 00:32:48,440
I'm a constable,

643
00:32:49,240 --> 00:32:50,440
and you're a suspect.

644
00:32:51,110 --> 00:32:52,200
What do you think?

645
00:32:53,160 --> 00:32:55,030
Ever since
the Young Girl Spice-Refining Case,

646
00:32:55,030 --> 00:32:56,570
you've first trespassed into
the Tianshu Pavilion

647
00:32:56,570 --> 00:32:58,350
as a suspect,

648
00:32:58,510 --> 00:32:59,310
and now,

649
00:32:59,310 --> 00:33:00,480
you've followed us
all the way to Dougu County,

650
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:02,310
and even appeared here
in this Black Wind Forest.

651
00:33:02,310 --> 00:33:04,200
All you speak of is the case.

652
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:06,350
If you're not the true culprit,

653
00:33:06,350 --> 00:33:08,410
then you must be up to something else.

654
00:33:08,550 --> 00:33:09,750
Whatever the reason,

655
00:33:12,240 --> 00:33:14,840
you can explain it back
at the Bureau yourself.

656
00:33:16,590 --> 00:33:18,270
Lady Moon,

657
00:33:18,530 --> 00:33:26,900
[Spring Blossoms, Autumn Harvest]

658
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,640
shine upon the eastern wall.

659
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:25,510
In the depths of the alley,
there is honeyed candy.

660
00:33:26,400 --> 00:33:28,110
Follow me,

661
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:30,640
make no sound—

662
00:33:31,270 --> 00:33:35,480
I'll dress you in a paper garment.

663
00:33:36,510 --> 00:33:38,200
The road before the door

664
00:33:38,640 --> 00:33:40,480
leads to my homeland.

665
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:45,830
In my house,
there's a piece of crystal candy,

666
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:51,200
buried beneath the tree
with the scent of bones.

667
00:33:56,070 --> 00:33:56,880
Youyou.

668
00:33:57,270 --> 00:33:58,070
Cuicui.

669
00:33:58,680 --> 00:33:59,590
Yuanbao.

670
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:01,510
Man.

671
00:34:02,070 --> 00:34:02,920
Nu.

672
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,200
Yingzi.

673
00:34:04,920 --> 00:34:06,720
Come out and play.

674
00:34:09,190 --> 00:34:10,110
Come on.

675
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,840
Come on.

676
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:14,320
Come and play.

677
00:34:19,110 --> 00:34:20,840
The wind is cold,

678
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:23,030
the night is long.

679
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:28,630
Obedient little kid,
sleep soundly and sweet.

680
00:34:29,630 --> 00:34:31,360
Close your eyes

681
00:34:32,230 --> 00:34:34,350
and sing with me.

682
00:34:35,070 --> 00:34:40,510
In a few steps,
you'll be by your mother's side.

683
00:34:40,710 --> 00:34:43,230
[In the second month of spring,]

684
00:34:41,270 --> 00:34:44,850
[Hongyun Era,]

685
00:34:43,230 --> 00:34:44,230
[Dashi Dynasty,]

686
00:34:44,670 --> 00:34:46,000
[in Dougu County, Suzhou,]

687
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,030
[6 more children]

688
00:34:47,030 --> 00:34:49,030
[went missing overnight.]

689
00:34:49,480 --> 00:34:51,030
[The total number of missing children]

690
00:34:51,030 --> 00:34:53,190
[has now risen to 35.]

691
00:34:55,110 --> 00:34:56,110
My poor daughter!

692
00:34:55,420 --> 00:34:58,190
[Dougu County Office]

693
00:34:56,110 --> 00:34:58,110
Officers, please help us look for them!

694
00:34:58,110 --> 00:34:59,030
Exactly!

695
00:34:59,030 --> 00:34:59,800
Officers!

696
00:35:00,320 --> 00:35:01,400
What should we do?

697
00:35:01,400 --> 00:35:02,670
-Get up now. Get up.
-We have no idea

698
00:35:02,670 --> 00:35:03,480
where your children are, either!

699
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:04,920
Help me look for Yuanbao, please!

700
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:06,510
We've already issued a notice!

701
00:35:06,510 --> 00:35:07,480
Go back now!

702
00:35:08,550 --> 00:35:09,190
My Lord.

703
00:35:09,190 --> 00:35:11,190
Please help me look for Yuanbao.

704
00:35:11,230 --> 00:35:12,550
Go home! Go home!

705
00:35:12,840 --> 00:35:14,480
Maybe you simply
didn't watch them properly,

706
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:15,410
and the children

707
00:35:15,590 --> 00:35:16,360
ran off on their own.

708
00:35:16,360 --> 00:35:17,280
Am I right?

709
00:35:17,280 --> 00:35:18,190
That's right.

710
00:35:19,230 --> 00:35:20,150
Go back!

711
00:35:20,230 --> 00:35:21,440
I'm so sorry, kid.

712
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:22,670
Get up and go back.

713
00:35:22,670 --> 00:35:23,480
Even if you kneel here,

714
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:24,670
there's nothing we can do.

715
00:35:24,670 --> 00:35:27,320
We've already done what we could
and issued a notice.

716
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:29,710
To abduct so many children
in a single night...

717
00:35:29,710 --> 00:35:31,040
This is sheer audacity.

718
00:35:31,510 --> 00:35:32,590
No matter what,

719
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:33,960
targeting children

720
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:35,440
is unforgivable.

721
00:35:36,960 --> 00:35:37,670
My Lord!

722
00:35:37,670 --> 00:35:38,360
Stop kneeling here!

723
00:35:38,360 --> 00:35:39,840
Go back now.

724
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,960
Move! Move!

725
00:35:42,190 --> 00:35:44,110
Get up! Get up!

726
00:35:44,110 --> 00:35:45,320
-Come on, leave!
-Go home. Go home.

727
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:46,070
Stop kneeling here!

728
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:46,360
Hurry up.

729
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:47,070
Stop!

730
00:35:55,670 --> 00:35:56,480
Yuyao.

731
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:57,630
Yuyao.

732
00:35:57,630 --> 00:35:59,150
Mrs. Hua, don't worry.

733
00:35:59,190 --> 00:36:01,190
The lady and gentleman
from the Divine Constable Bureau

734
00:36:01,190 --> 00:36:02,840
will definitely bring Yuanbao

735
00:36:02,840 --> 00:36:03,840
back.

736
00:36:07,070 --> 00:36:07,760
Yuyao stayed with me

737
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:09,380
at the county government
all night last night.

738
00:36:09,380 --> 00:36:13,160
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

739
00:36:09,630 --> 00:36:10,480
Mrs. Hua.

740
00:36:10,800 --> 00:36:12,070
With Yuyao's current situation,

741
00:36:12,070 --> 00:36:13,590
can she stay at your place for a few days?

742
00:36:13,590 --> 00:36:15,070
Once the case is solved,
we'll come to pick her up.

743
00:36:15,070 --> 00:36:15,710
Don't worry.

744
00:36:15,710 --> 00:36:17,070
I'll have someone protect her.

745
00:36:17,070 --> 00:36:17,760
Okay.

746
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:19,800
Alright then, good girl.

747
00:36:19,800 --> 00:36:20,840
From today onward,

748
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:22,550
you'll be staying at my home.

749
00:36:26,510 --> 00:36:27,440
My Lord, My Lady.

750
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:29,030
This is not the first time

751
00:36:29,030 --> 00:36:30,510
this kind of thing has happened.

752
00:36:30,510 --> 00:36:32,000
The first few times
the children went missing,

753
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,030
a few parents came to cry

754
00:36:32,090 --> 00:36:34,040
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

755
00:36:33,030 --> 00:36:34,320
at our gate too.

756
00:36:34,320 --> 00:36:36,590
I also felt deeply sorry for them.

757
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:37,840
But over time,

758
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:39,440
they kept making a scene
at the gate of the county government.

759
00:36:39,440 --> 00:36:40,510
This is, after all, a government office

760
00:36:40,510 --> 00:36:42,630
-and a courtroom—it simply isn't proper...
-Folks.

761
00:36:42,630 --> 00:36:44,630
Punishing evil and protecting the people

762
00:36:43,620 --> 00:36:45,380
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

763
00:36:44,630 --> 00:36:45,920
is the duty of our Divine Constable Bureau

764
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:48,480
-and the local authorities.
-Of course. Of course.

765
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:49,590
Please rest assured.

766
00:36:49,590 --> 00:36:49,840
We'll definitely

767
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:51,280
bring the missing children back,

768
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:52,670
and we'll make those
who commit these crimes

769
00:36:52,670 --> 00:36:53,840
confess and face justice.

770
00:36:53,010 --> 00:36:53,930
[Dougu County Office]

771
00:36:54,320 --> 00:36:55,840
Please seek justice for us, My Lady!

772
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:56,480
Thank you, My Lady!

773
00:36:56,480 --> 00:36:57,190
Thank you.

774
00:36:57,840 --> 00:37:00,000
Well said, Lady Constable Frost.

775
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:02,360
How many children have gone missing?

776
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,150
Six.

777
00:37:03,230 --> 00:37:03,840
Was there no disturbance at all

778
00:37:03,840 --> 00:37:05,070
in the county last night?

779
00:37:05,070 --> 00:37:06,920
Not a sound, not a trace.

780
00:37:07,070 --> 00:37:08,600
No one knows how it was done.

781
00:37:19,590 --> 00:37:21,250
This doesn't concern with me.

782
00:37:23,710 --> 00:37:24,510
Mr. Du,

783
00:37:24,300 --> 00:37:27,450
[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

784
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:25,800
may I borrow your courtroom?

785
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:27,030
Please suit yourself, My Lady.

786
00:37:27,030 --> 00:37:27,800
Hold on.

787
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:28,800
Record all the information these people

788
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:29,510
have provided about the children—

789
00:37:29,510 --> 00:37:30,510
their circumstances,
their home addresses,

790
00:37:30,510 --> 00:37:31,280
and family members.

791
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:32,400
-Take everything down.
-Got it.

792
00:37:32,400 --> 00:37:35,060
-We'll fetch some paper and brushes.
-Let's go.

793
00:37:37,590 --> 00:37:39,070
-Everyone, please go home.
-Please go home.

794
00:37:39,070 --> 00:37:40,510
Go on. Don't stand here.

795
00:37:40,510 --> 00:37:41,230
Go on.

796
00:37:41,230 --> 00:37:42,510
Go on. Go on.

797
00:37:43,510 --> 00:37:44,280
Go back home.

798
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,070
Go home.

799
00:37:48,190 --> 00:37:49,000
How weird.

800
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:52,450
[Dougu County Office]

801
00:37:53,230 --> 00:37:54,630
I was examining the body in the morgue
last night,

802
00:37:54,630 --> 00:37:55,230
and I didn't hear

803
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:56,590
any unusual movement.

804
00:37:56,670 --> 00:37:58,230
Did anyone see the puppet doll?

805
00:37:58,230 --> 00:37:58,920
I've asked about it.

806
00:37:58,920 --> 00:37:59,670
No one did.

807
00:38:00,190 --> 00:38:00,840
That person

808
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:02,230
abducted 6 children

809
00:38:02,230 --> 00:38:04,000
without anyone noticing.

810
00:38:04,320 --> 00:38:06,650
He must have used highly unusual methods.

811
00:38:07,230 --> 00:38:07,960
We should still

812
00:38:07,960 --> 00:38:10,110
start by investigating the puppet doll.

813
00:38:10,110 --> 00:38:11,510
Didn't witnesses report

814
00:38:11,920 --> 00:38:13,440
seeing them at the scenes

815
00:38:13,630 --> 00:38:15,440
of the earlier disappearances?

816
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:21,760
Last night, he deliberately

817
00:38:21,760 --> 00:38:22,710
led me to the Black Wind Forest.

818
00:38:22,710 --> 00:38:23,970
Lady Constable Frost.

819
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:25,070
We found

820
00:38:25,070 --> 00:38:26,880
the missing children's empty graves.

821
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:27,630
Besides,

822
00:38:28,320 --> 00:38:29,480
I also found that

823
00:38:29,880 --> 00:38:32,070
the silk thread that got Master Sun killed

824
00:38:32,070 --> 00:38:33,070
can not only be used

825
00:38:33,070 --> 00:38:34,600
to control the puppet doll—

826
00:38:34,710 --> 00:38:36,340
many martial artists also often

827
00:38:36,340 --> 00:38:38,030
use it as a stealth weapon.

828
00:38:38,230 --> 00:38:40,360
It's called the Spider's Tear.

829
00:38:40,920 --> 00:38:41,840
No matter how I see it,

830
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:43,510
you are the most suspicious.

831
00:38:44,550 --> 00:38:45,320
But last night,

832
00:38:45,320 --> 00:38:47,070
I was in Black Wind Forest with him.

833
00:38:47,070 --> 00:38:48,400
So when the children went missing,

834
00:38:48,400 --> 00:38:49,510
you were together all along?

835
00:38:49,510 --> 00:38:50,360
Exactly.

836
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:53,070
So you should know

837
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:55,150
the case has nothing to do with me.

838
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:56,280
We should start with

839
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:57,800
the puppet doll.

840
00:39:01,030 --> 00:39:02,230
You wouldn't listen to reason

841
00:39:02,230 --> 00:39:04,230
and insisted on taking the hard way.

842
00:39:05,190 --> 00:39:06,550
What else can I say?

843
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:09,110
He may have other accomplices.

844
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:10,320
The Chief wants to interrogate him.

845
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:12,320
I'll take him back to Tianhuang City.

846
00:39:12,320 --> 00:39:14,000
It's dangerous for you to go alone.

847
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:14,920
He's cunning.

848
00:39:15,190 --> 00:39:16,030
Once the case is solved,

849
00:39:16,030 --> 00:39:17,560
let's escort him together.

850
00:39:17,590 --> 00:39:18,400
Okay.

851
00:39:18,160 --> 00:39:19,190
[Just and Upright] [The People First]

852
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:22,460
What are you doing?

853
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:25,400
This item is suspicious.

854
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:26,630
I can't leave it with you.

855
00:39:26,630 --> 00:39:27,800
How ungrateful,

856
00:39:27,800 --> 00:39:29,060
Lord Constable Ghost.

857
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:31,030
You did save me,

858
00:39:31,400 --> 00:39:32,880
but I'm just doing my job.

859
00:39:33,230 --> 00:39:34,320
A weapon of this kind

860
00:39:34,320 --> 00:39:36,520
cannot be left in the hands of a suspect.

861
00:39:37,800 --> 00:39:39,000
Bad news! Bad news!

862
00:39:39,440 --> 00:39:40,710
Something bad happened!

863
00:39:39,530 --> 00:39:42,530
[Just and Upright] [The People First]

864
00:39:41,190 --> 00:39:43,030
Master Sun's body disappeared!

865
00:39:43,070 --> 00:39:44,110
What do you mean it disappeared?

866
00:39:44,110 --> 00:39:46,000
The morgue is completely empty.

867
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:46,880
Not a single one of

868
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:48,740
the dismembered remains is left!

869
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:50,880
I examined the corpse alone last night

870
00:39:50,880 --> 00:39:52,010
until 3 to 5 o'clock.

871
00:39:52,840 --> 00:39:53,960
Stealing a corpse

872
00:39:54,230 --> 00:39:55,840
is usually done to prevent anything

873
00:39:55,840 --> 00:39:58,400
from being discovered
during an examination.

874
00:39:58,400 --> 00:39:59,860
But Lady Constable Frost,

875
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,110
we've already extracted

876
00:40:01,110 --> 00:40:02,670
nearly everything we needed
from the remains.

877
00:40:02,670 --> 00:40:04,360
So what would be the purpose of

878
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:05,920
taking the body away at a time like this?

879
00:40:05,920 --> 00:40:06,630
Weren't there guards

880
00:40:06,630 --> 00:40:07,800
at the door of the morgue?

881
00:40:07,800 --> 00:40:08,320
Well...

882
00:40:08,320 --> 00:40:09,510
According to Your Lordship's instruction,

883
00:40:09,510 --> 00:40:11,440
there were guards there all along.

884
00:40:12,230 --> 00:40:13,110
Then how did they manage to do that

885
00:40:13,110 --> 00:40:14,280
without anyone noticing?

886
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:15,710
Isn't it obvious?

887
00:40:16,230 --> 00:40:17,960
They didn't steal or snatch it—

888
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:20,030
they took it away

889
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:21,940
openly and legitimately.

890
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:25,070
So who could enter the morgue

891
00:40:25,070 --> 00:40:27,440
in a perfectly natural way,
without raising suspicion?

892
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:28,480
Unless

893
00:40:28,480 --> 00:40:29,540
it was the coroner.

894
00:40:29,630 --> 00:40:30,440
Where is Wen Nansheng?

895
00:40:30,440 --> 00:40:31,110
Call him here!

896
00:40:31,110 --> 00:40:32,110
I saw him

897
00:40:32,110 --> 00:40:33,320
leaving the county government
carrying a bundle

898
00:40:33,320 --> 00:40:34,360
and heading west.

899
00:40:36,030 --> 00:40:37,110
Divine Constables!

900
00:40:37,110 --> 00:40:38,190
Keep a close watch on the suspect, Li Si!

901
00:40:38,190 --> 00:40:39,110
Got it! Got it!

902
00:40:39,590 --> 00:40:40,360
He's in my custody.

903
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,560
You can rest assured!

904
00:40:42,480 --> 00:40:43,280
Guards!

905
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:43,880
Yes!

906
00:40:43,880 --> 00:40:45,400
Lock this guy up in prison.

907
00:40:49,760 --> 00:40:50,550
Where is he?

908
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:52,360
Where did he go?

909
00:41:06,070 --> 00:41:06,880
Meng.

910
00:41:07,070 --> 00:41:08,110
There's the scent of Dead Bone Spice

911
00:41:08,110 --> 00:41:09,480
on Master Sun's dismembered remains.

912
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,480
Wen Nansheng didn't go far.

913
00:41:10,480 --> 00:41:11,740
Can you still smell it?

914
00:41:18,230 --> 00:41:19,070
This way.

915
00:41:19,110 --> 00:41:20,170
[Hefeng Tavern]

916
00:41:52,630 --> 00:41:53,400
Stop it!
